    dc:type "resolution-route/proof";
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Proposed test with existing data: Check a reduction mapping an arbitrary infinite cellular-automaton evolution or halting instance to existence of a solution of an equation using integers, arithmetic, and trigonometric functions. Correct equivalence proves undecidability; a flaw in the encoding refutes the construction.";
