    <https://w3id.org/delphi/ontology/assessmentType> "dataset-resolvability/0.2.0";
    <https://w3id.org/delphi/ontology/evidenceAgainst> "The contrast with pure polynomial equations changes when integer rather than real solutions are allowed.", "The statement depends on the exact equation language, domain, and meaning of 'finding a solution'.";
